WEBVTT

00:05:59.984 --> 00:06:02.187
by a monster this big.

00:06:02.187 --> 00:06:04.121
The only thing to do

00:06:04.121 --> 00:06:05.955
is to get up, make a cup of tea

00:06:05.955 --> 00:06:11.271
and sit down with the fear like a child beside you.

00:06:11.271 --> 00:06:13.752
You're the adult.

00:06:13.752 --> 00:06:15.639
The fear is the child.

00:06:15.639 --> 00:06:17.084
And you talk to the fear

00:06:17.084 --> 00:06:20.270
and you ask it what it wants, what it needs.

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:24.887
How can this be made better?

00:06:24.887 --> 00:06:26.637
How can the child feel stronger?

00:06:26.637 --> 00:06:28.086
And you make a plan.

00:06:28.086 --> 00:06:30.091
And you say, "Okay, now we're going back to sleep.